<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW" class="h-full">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Relic | 時光餘額</title>
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- Google Fonts: Noto Serif TC & Inter for Japanese/Zen aesthetic -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@300;400;600;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Supabase Client -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@supabase/supabase-js@2"></script>
  <!-- Canvas Confetti for celebratory micro-animations -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      darkMode: 'class',
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            serif: ['"Noto Serif TC"', 'serif'],
            sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            wabi: {
              cream: '#FAF7F2',
              sand: '#F2ECE1',
              paper: '#EBE3D5',
              stone: '#8A8275',
              ink: '#23201D',
              moss: '#657153',
              clay: '#B86F52',
              gold: '#D4A373'
            }
          },
          boxShadow: {
            'glass': '0 8px 32px 0 rgba(35, 32, 29, 0.05)',
            'glass-hover': '0 12px 40px 0 rgba(35, 32, 29, 0.1)'
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>

  <style>
    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(35, 32, 29, 0.03) 1px, transparent 0);
      background-size: 24px 24px;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .glass-card {
      background: rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(235, 227, 213, 0.8);
    }
    .dark .glass-card {
      background: rgba(30, 27, 24, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(60, 55, 50, 0.6);
    }
    .timer-glow {
      text-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.25);
    }
    @keyframes subtlePulse {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.95; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.015); opacity: 1; }
    }
    .breath-anim {
      animation: subtlePulse 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body class="bg-wabi-cream text-wabi-ink dark:bg-[#181614] dark:text-[#E8E2D9] font-sans antialiased min-h-full transition-colors duration-500 selection:bg-wabi-gold/30">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 w-full border-b border-wabi-sand/80 dark:border-stone-800 glass-card">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
        <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-wabi-ink text-wabi-cream dark:bg-wabi-cream dark:text-wabi-ink flex items-center justify-center font-serif text-sm font-semibold tracking-tighter">餘</span>
        <div>
          <h1 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg tracking-wider text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-100">Relic <span class="text-xs font-normal font-sans opacity-50 ml-1">時光餘額</span></h1>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <button id="upgradeBadgeBtn" onclick="openUpgradeModal()" class="px-2.5 py-1 text-xs rounded-full border border-wabi-gold/60 text-wabi-clay dark:text-wabi-gold bg-wabi-gold/10 hover:bg-wabi-gold/20 transition flex items-center gap-1">
          <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"></path></svg>
          <span id="userTierText">免費方案 (1/1)</span>
        </button>

        <button id="osModeBtn" onclick="toggleOSMode()" class="text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-wabi-sand/80 bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-800 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink transition flex items-center gap-1">
          <span id="osModeLabel">🍎 iOS</span>
        </button>

        <select id="langSelect" onchange="changeLanguage(this.value)" class="text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded-lg border border-wabi-sand/80 bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-800 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink focus:outline-none cursor-pointer">
          <option value="zh-TW">繁體中文</option>
          <option value="en">English</option>
          <option value="ja">日本語</option>
        </select>

        <button id="toggleProTestBtn" onclick="toggleProMode()" class="text-xs px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-wabi-clay/40 text-wabi-clay hover:bg-wabi-clay/10 transition flex items-center gap-1">
          <span data-i18n="tryProBtn">⚡ 體驗 Pro</span>
        </button>

        <div class="relative inline-block">
          <button id="authBtn" onclick="toggleUserDropdown()" class="text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-wabi-stone/30 hover:border-wabi-stone hover:bg-white/40 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 transition flex items-center gap-1">
            <span id="authBtnText" data-i18n="googleLogin">Google 登入</span>
            <svg class="w-3 h-3 opacity-60" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div id="userDropdown" class="absolute right-0 mt-2 w-44 rounded-2xl glass-card border border-wabi-sand dark:border-stone-800 shadow-xl py-1.5 hidden z-50 text-xs">
            <button onclick="openPrivacyModal(); closeUserDropdown();" class="w-full text-left px-3.5 py-2 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink hover:bg-wabi-sand/40 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>📜</span> <span data-i18n="privacyPolicy">隱私權政策</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="promptDeleteAccount(); closeUserDropdown();" class="w-full text-left px-3.5 py-2 text-red-600/80 hover:text-red-600 hover:bg-red-500/10 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>⚠️</span> <span data-i18n="deleteAccount">刪除帳號 (App Store 規範)</span>
            </button>
            <div class="border-t border-wabi-sand/50 my-1"></div>
            <button onclick="handleAuthAction(); closeUserDropdown();" id="dropdownAuthAction" class="w-full text-left px-3.5 py-2 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink hover:bg-wabi-sand/40 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span>🚪</span> <span data-i18n="loginOrLogout">登入帳號</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-6 pb-28">
    <div class="flex justify-center mb-8">
      <nav class="inline-flex p-1 rounded-2xl glass-card shadow-glass border border-wabi-sand dark:border-stone-800" aria-label="Tabs">
        <button id="tabCountdown" onclick="switchView('countdown')" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-300 bg-wabi-ink text-wabi-cream dark:bg-stone-100 dark:text-stone-900 shadow-sm">
          ⏳ 時光指針
        </button>
        <button id="tabJournal" onclick="switchView('journal')" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-300 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink dark:hover:text-stone-200">
          📜 時光手札
        </button>
        <button id="tabGarden" onclick="switchView('garden')" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium transition-all duration-300 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink dark:hover:text-stone-200 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span>🌸 回憶花園</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-wabi-clay/20 text-wabi-clay px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-sans">Pro</span>
        </button>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <!-- Countdown View -->
    <div id="viewCountdown" class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <label for="targetSelect" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-wabi-stone font-semibold" data-i18n="currentTargetLabel">目前計算對象</label>
          <select id="targetSelect" onchange="onTargetChanged()" class="text-sm bg-transparent border-b border-wabi-stone/40 pb-0.5 focus:outline-none focus:border-wabi-ink font-serif font-medium cursor-pointer">
            <option value="1">媽媽 (返鄉陪伴)</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <button onclick="openEditTargetModal()" class="text-xs flex items-center gap-1 text-wabi-clay hover:text-wabi-ink dark:hover:text-stone-200 transition">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"></path></svg>
            <span data-i18n="editFarewellBtn">修改告別時刻</span>
          </button>
          <button onclick="handleAddNewTargetClick()" class="text-xs flex items-center gap-1 text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink dark:hover:text-stone-200 transition">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            <span data-i18n="addTargetBtn">新增對象</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-glass relative overflow-hidden text-center breath-anim">
        <button onclick="openEditTargetModal()" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-wabi-sand/60 hover:bg-wabi-sand dark:bg-stone-800/60 dark:hover:bg-stone-800 text-xs font-serif text-wabi-ink/80 dark:text-stone-300 mb-6 transition cursor-pointer group">
          <span id="targetRelation">母親</span>
          <span class="opacity-40">•</span>
          <span id="turningPointLabel">告別時刻：2029/12/31 (預計移居海外)</span>
          <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-wabi-stone group-hover:text-wabi-clay transition-colors ml-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"></path></svg>
        </button>

        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-wabi-stone mb-2" data-i18n="remainingTimeHeader">此生預計真正相聚的餘額</p>
        
        <div class="my-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center tracking-tight timer-glow font-serif">
            <span id="displayHours" class="text-6xl sm:text-8xl font-bold text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-100 transition-all duration-700">384</span>
            <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl ml-2 font-normal text-wabi-stone font-sans" id="displayHoursUnit" data-i18n="hoursUnit">小時</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-2 text-xs font-mono text-wabi-stone tracking-wider opacity-80" id="displaySubTimer">
            約等同於 16.0 天相聚時光 • <span id="clockSecondsTicking">當前時間 00時 00分 00秒 悄然流逝</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto my-6">
          <div onclick="nextQuoteCard()" class="group relative px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-wabi-cream/60 dark:bg-stone-800/60 hover:bg-wabi-sand/50 dark:hover:bg-stone-800/90 border border-wabi-sand/70 dark:border-stone-800 text-xs font-serif leading-relaxed text-wabi-stone cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 shadow-sm hover:shadow hover:-translate-y-0.5 select-none">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] text-wabi-stone/70 mb-2 font-sans">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-wabi-clay"></span>
                <span id="quoteDayTag" data-i18n="dailyQuoteTag">本日心境字卡</span>
              </span>
              <span class="group-hover:text-wabi-clay transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
                <span id="quoteIndexIndicator">1 / 6</span>
                <svg class="w-3 h-3 transform group-hover:rotate-45 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"></path></svg>
              </span>
            </div>
            <p id="displayQuoteText" class="transition-opacity duration-300 min-h-[42px] flex items-center justify-center italic text-wabi-ink/90 dark:text-stone-200">
              「我們總以為日子還很長，但刨除睡眠與雜事，一年裡能圍在餐桌前聽她碎念的時光，其實只剩這三百多個小時。」
            </p>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-right mt-1.5 text-wabi-stone/60" data-i18n="quoteClickHint">點擊隨機翻閱 • 每日自動更換</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-wabi-sand/70 dark:border-stone-800/80 flex flex-col items-center">
          <button id="bonusBtn" onclick="openSurpriseMeetingModal()" class="group relative px-6 py-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-wabi-clay to-wabi-gold text-white font-medium shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transform active:scale-95 transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-lg">🌿</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-serif tracking-wide" data-i18n="surpriseVisitBtn">安排驚喜見面 (自訂 / AI 精算陪伴時長)</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">+Bonus</span>
          </button>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-wabi-stone mt-2.5" data-i18n="surpriseVisitDesc">點擊即化焦慮為行動。此生相聚的刻度，由你此刻的決定延長。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 shadow-glass">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <h3 class="text-xs uppercase font-semibold tracking-wider text-wabi-stone" data-i18n="freqModelTitle">相聚頻率演算模型</h3>
            <span id="calcModeBadge" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-wabi-gold/20 text-wabi-clay font-medium font-serif">基礎常規</span>
          </div>
          <button onclick="openFrequencyModal()" class="text-xs font-medium text-wabi-clay hover:text-wabi-ink dark:hover:text-stone-200 transition flex items-center gap-1">
            <span data-i18n="adjustFreqBtn">✨ 調整頻率與 AI 智慧推估</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-800/40 border border-wabi-sand/40">
            <span class="text-wabi-stone block mb-1" data-i18n="statAnnualHours">年均預估相聚時數</span>
            <span class="font-serif font-semibold text-sm" id="summaryFreq">約 96 小時 / 年</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-800/40 border border-wabi-sand/40">
            <span class="text-wabi-stone block mb-1" data-i18n="statPatternTitle">聚會規律特徵</span>
            <span class="font-serif font-semibold text-sm truncate block" id="summaryHoursPer">每月1次週末 (扣除睡眠)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-800/40 border border-wabi-sand/40">
            <span class="text-wabi-stone block mb-1" data-i18n="statBonusTitle">已累計奪回紅利</span>
            <span class="font-serif font-semibold text-sm text-wabi-clay" id="summaryBonus">+0 小時</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="aiReasoningBox" class="mt-3 p-3 rounded-xl bg-wabi-sand/30 dark:bg-stone-800/30 border border-wabi-sand/50 text-[11px] font-serif text-wabi-stone hidden">
          <span class="font-semibold text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200">🤖 AI 陪伴推估精算備忘：</span>
          <span id="aiReasoningText">--</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Journal View -->
    <div id="viewJournal" class="hidden space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg">時光手札 • 回憶膠囊</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-wabi-stone">每一場落幕的相聚，都值得被封存在琥珀色的記憶裡。</p>
        </div>
        <button onclick="openNewJournalModal()" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-wabi-ink text-wabi-cream dark:bg-stone-100 dark:text-stone-900 text-xs font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition">
          + 記錄這次相聚
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="capsulesContainer" class="space-y-4"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Garden View -->
    <div id="viewGarden" class="hidden space-y-6">
      <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-glass relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between pb-6 border-b border-wabi-sand dark:border-stone-800 gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-wabi-gold font-medium mb-1">
              <span>✦ Premium 專屬心靈庭園</span>
              <span id="gardenProTag" class="text-[10px] bg-wabi-gold/20 text-wabi-clay px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded-full font-sans">需 Pro 權限</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="font-serif font-semibold text-xl">回憶花園 (Memory Garden)</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-wabi-stone mt-1 max-w-md">
              將意念化為真實的牽絆。完成定期陪伴任務，在此灌溉只屬於你們的常青植物，並連結至特定時光日記。
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button onclick="openPlantSeedModal()" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-wabi-moss text-white text-xs font-medium hover:bg-opacity-90 transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow-sm">
              <span>🌱 種下新回憶花木</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="waterAllPlants()" class="px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-white/70 dark:bg-stone-800 text-wabi-clay border border-wabi-clay/30 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-wabi-sand/60 transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span>💧 全園澆灌</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="my-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-wabi-sand/30 to-wabi-sand/70 dark:from-stone-900/40 dark:to-stone-900/80 border border-wabi-sand/60 dark:border-stone-800 flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[260px] text-center">
          <div id="gardenPlots" class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8 items-end w-full max-w-2xl px-2"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-wabi-sand dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-900/40">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <h4 class="font-serif font-medium text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span>🌱 今日暖心任務提案</span>
                <span id="taskDateTag" class="text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-wabi-sand dark:bg-stone-800 font-sans text-wabi-stone">每日更新</span>
              </h4>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <button onclick="completeTaskAndWater()" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-wabi-moss/20 text-wabi-moss hover:bg-wabi-moss hover:text-white transition font-medium">
                  ✓ 標記完成並澆水
                </button>
                <button onclick="shuffleDailyTask()" class="text-[10px] text-wabi-clay hover:underline flex items-center gap-0.5">
                  <span>換一個</span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p id="dailyTaskText" class="text-wabi-stone leading-relaxed transition-opacity duration-300">「打一通不帶目的的 10 分鐘電話，問問媽媽小時候最喜歡吃的一道點心。」完成後可為庭園澆水。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-wabi-sand dark:border-stone-800 bg-white/40 dark:bg-stone-900/40">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1">
              <h4 class="font-serif font-medium text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200">花語與陪伴象徵</h4>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-wabi-stone" id="gardenStatsText">已培育 3 朵花木</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-wabi-stone leading-relaxed">每一株植物皆與特定的時光手札綁定。透過日常微小的陪伴與關懷，花木將從芽苗緩緩含苞、盛開，象徵這段關係中多了一座不可磨滅的燈塔。</p>
          </div>
