  <div id="upgradeModal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center px-4 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm hidden opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300">
    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 max-w-sm w-full shadow-2xl text-center border border-wabi-gold/50">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-wabi-gold/20 text-wabi-clay flex items-center justify-center text-xl mb-3">👑</div>
      <h3 class="font-serif font-bold text-xl text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-100">解鎖 Relic Premium</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-wabi-stone mt-2 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
        免費用戶上限為 1 個相聚對象。升級專屬時光守護者，為所有你深愛的人具象化相聚餘額。
      </p>
      <div class="space-y-2 text-left text-xs bg-wabi-sand/40 dark:bg-stone-800/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl mb-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200"><span class="text-wabi-moss">✓</span> 無限新增對象 (父母、兒女、摯友、毛孩)</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200"><span class="text-wabi-moss">✓</span> 解鎖完整「回憶花園」培育與日記綁定</div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-wabi-ink dark:text-stone-200"><span class="text-wabi-moss">✓</span> 雲端多裝置即時同步與相片高畫質封存</div>
      </div>
      <button onclick="simulateUpgradeSuccess()" class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-wabi-clay to-wabi-gold text-white text-xs font-semibold shadow hover:opacity-95 transition">
        以月杯咖啡贊助 (NT$ 49 / 月)
      </button>
      <button onclick="toggleProMode(); closeUpgradeModal();" class="mt-2 w-full py-2 rounded-xl border border-wabi-clay/50 text-wabi-clay hover:bg-wabi-clay/10 text-xs font-medium transition">
        ⚡ 立即開啟 Pro 體驗模式 (測試確認效果)
      </button>
      <button onclick="closeUpgradeModal()" class="mt-2 text-xs text-wabi-stone hover:text-wabi-ink block mx-auto">暫時保留</button>
